# Expanding Horizons (jeuno 134), each finish once its section no longer holds (a GM's change while the event is open): a
# level 76 Warrior with the Limit Breaker at cap 80, New Worlds Await completed. 10045 open, then cap 81: finish option 7
# does nothing (not begun); cap 80 again: begun. Accepted, 4 merit points, five crests: 10136 open, then the quest set
# available (its first section holds; 10136's finish is the accepted section's): nothing (crests kept, merits 4, cap 80).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10136
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=76
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 80
merits 4
quest Jeuno.NewWorldsAwait completed
item KindredsCrest x5
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # 10045 (76, 1, 2, 0)
levelcap 81                             # a GM, 10045 open
finish option=7                         # cap 81: no section: nothing (not begun)
levelcap 80                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # 10045 (76, 1, 2, 0)
finish option=7                         # begun
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x5     # 10136
quest Jeuno.ExpandingHorizons available # a GM, 10136 open
finish                                  # available: nothing
